d 'DASHBOARDBUILDER': module to build a self-contained interactive HTML dashboard from Stata
d
d  A putdocx-style builder: init -> tab -> panel -> build. Each
d panel call snapshots the data currently in memory; build writes
d ONE self-contained HTML file (inline JSON data, readable vanilla
d SVG/JS charts, no CDN). Tabs; kpi/line/bar/hbar/compare/table
d panels plus an html panel that inlines an external HTML file
d (e.g. a sparkta2 map) as an iframe; a selector dropdown with a
d reference-unit overlay; per-panel CSV/PNG downloads; save-as-PDF;
d callout and source notes; Texas 2036 or neutral theming; and a
d build receipt listing what likely still needs a human pass. only;
d nothing to pip install). See help dashboardbuilder. License: MIT 
d
d KW: graphics; HTML; dashboard; reporting
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f dashboardbuilder.ado
f dashboardbuilder.py
f dashboardbuilder.sthlp
f ../e/example_dashboardbuilder.do
f ../e/example_dashboardbuilder_map.do
f ../t/texas_counties.csv
